[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368133293","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111246#issuecomment-3368133293","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111246","id":3368133293,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IwaKt","user":{"login":"EvarDion","id":18524364,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTI0MzY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18524364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion","html_url":"https://github.com/EvarDion","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-04T11:09:26Z","updated_at":"2025-10-04T11:09:26Z","body":"Temporary Workaround: Forcing the Editor to Use the .NET 10 RC Runtime\n\nInstructions:\n1. Locate the Configuration File\nNavigate to the Godot editor's internal API assemblies directory. The path is typically:\n_[Your Godot 4.5 Installation Folder]_\\GodotSharp\\Api\\Debug\\\n_(Note: The folder may be named Release instead of Debug)_\nLook for the file named GodotPlugins.runtimeconfig.json.\n\n2. Edit the File\nOpen GodotPlugins.runtimeconfig.json in any text editor. It will contain the following content:\n\n```JSON\n{\n  \"runtimeOptions\": {\n    \"tfm\": \"net8.0\",\n    \"framework\": {\n      \"name\": \"Microsoft.NETCore.App\",\n      \"version\": \"8.0.0\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nModify the tfm and version fields to point to your installed .NET 10 Release Candidate. The file should look like this after editing:\n\n```JSON\n{\n  \"runtimeOptions\": {\n    \"tfm\": \"net10.0\",\n    \"framework\": {\n      \"name\": \"Microsoft.NETCore.App\",\n      \"version\": \"10.0.0-rc.1.25451.107\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n(Ensure the version string exactly matches the .NET 10 RC version you have installed).\n\nNote: this may or may not work if you have other C# plugins installed that were compiled with older versions of .NET","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368133293/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368241213","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111246#issuecomment-3368241213","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111246","id":3368241213,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Iw0g9","user":{"login":"scgm0","id":52148221,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTQ4MjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52148221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0","html_url":"https://github.com/scgm0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-04T13:36:23Z","updated_at":"2025-10-04T13:36:23Z","body":"Please try`DOTNET_ROLL_FORWARD_TO_PRERELEASE=1`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368241213/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368596585","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111246#issuecomment-3368596585","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111246","id":3368596585,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IyLRp","user":{"login":"EvarDion","id":18524364,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTI0MzY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18524364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion","html_url":"https://github.com/EvarDion","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-04T23:14:39Z","updated_at":"2025-10-04T23:17:44Z","body":"@scgm0  Thanks, that works also but I'll keep the bug open because this should be the default behaviour if the system cannot find a .NET framework that matches the .csproj file instead of falling back to a previous .NET version and then failing with a meaningless \".NET: Failed to load project assembly.\" error.\n\nor at the very least the error message in the IDE should report what the actual problem is and tell the user to try DOTNET_ROLL_FORWARD_TO_PRERELEASE=1 instead of telling them just to restart the IDE.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368596585/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368919629","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111246#issuecomment-3368919629","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111246","id":3368919629,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IzaJN","user":{"login":"scgm0","id":52148221,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTQ4MjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52148221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0","html_url":"https://github.com/scgm0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-05T10:10:08Z","updated_at":"2025-10-05T10:10:54Z","body":"> [@scgm0](https://github.com/scgm0) Thanks, that works also but I'll keep the bug open because this should be the default behaviour if the system cannot find a .NET framework that matches the .csproj file instead of falling back to a previous .NET version and then failing with a meaningless \".NET: Failed to load project assembly.\" error.\n> \n> or at the very least the error message in the IDE should report what the actual problem is and tell the user to try DOTNET_ROLL_FORWARD_TO_PRERELEASE=1 instead of telling them just to restart the IDE.\n\nIt's strange. The error I'm encountering here is the inability to find the assembly for dotnet10. Based on this error, I came across `DOTNET_ROLL_FORWARD_TO_PRERELEASE`, which seems to be an issue with the .NET runtime selection mechanism. However, I don't understand why the error you're encountering is different.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368919629/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368987875","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111246#issuecomment-3368987875","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111246","id":3368987875,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Izqzj","user":{"login":"EvarDion","id":18524364,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTI0MzY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18524364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion","html_url":"https://github.com/EvarDion","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvarDion/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-05T11:26:12Z","updated_at":"2025-10-05T12:04:39Z","body":"@scgm0 I have multiple versions of .NET runtimes on my machine, that might be why you are getting different error messages.\n\nIn my case it looks like the default behaviour of Godot 4.5 is to load the .NET 8.0 or roll forward to 8.0.2 or 9.0 (with the LatestMajor flag set in the runtimeconfig.json) but the version it finds is lower than the .NET version in the .csproj file (.NET 10) so after loading the .NET Framework it fails to load the project DLL because .NET 8.0.2 (or 9.0) doesn't know how to load .NET 10 assemblies.\n\nIf .NET 8 and 9 are not installed then it might give a different message.\n\nInstalled on my machine:\nMicrosoft.NETCore.App 8.0.20\nMicrosoft.NETCore.App 9.0.9\nMicrosoft.NETCore.App 10.0.0-rc.1.25451.107\n\n**.Net Runtimes Resolution Summary**\n```\nhostfxr Default  (LatestPatch)  → .NET 8.0.20\nruntimeconfig.json (LatestMajor)  → .NET 9.0.9\nDOTNET_ROLL_FORWARD_TO_PRERELEASE=1  → .NET 10.0.0-rc\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368987875/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3369049386","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111246#issuecomment-3369049386","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111246","id":3369049386,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Iz50q","user":{"login":"scgm0","id":52148221,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTQ4MjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52148221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0","html_url":"https://github.com/scgm0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-05T13:11:16Z","updated_at":"2025-10-05T13:11:16Z","body":"> [@scgm0](https://github.com/scgm0) I have multiple versions of .NET runtimes on my machine, that might be why you are getting different error messages.\n> \n> In my case it looks like the default behaviour of Godot 4.5 is to load the .NET 8.0 or roll forward to 8.0.2 or 9.0 (with the LatestMajor flag set in the runtimeconfig.json) but the version it finds is lower than the .NET version in the .csproj file (.NET 10) so after loading the .NET Framework it fails to load the project DLL because .NET 8.0.2 (or 9.0) doesn't know how to load .NET 10 assemblies.\n> \n> If .NET 8 and 9 are not installed then it might give a different message.\n> \n> Installed on my machine: Microsoft.NETCore.App 8.0.20 Microsoft.NETCore.App 9.0.9 Microsoft.NETCore.App 10.0.0-rc.1.25451.107\n> \n> **.Net Runtimes Resolution Summary**\n> \n> ```\n> hostfxr Default  (LatestPatch)  → .NET 8.0.20\n> runtimeconfig.json (LatestMajor)  → .NET 9.0.9\n> DOTNET_ROLL_FORWARD_TO_PRERELEASE=1  → .NET 10.0.0-rc\n> ```\n\nI have also installed multiple .NET runtimes and SDKs.\n```\ndotnet --list-runtimes\nMicrosoft.AspNetCore.App 9.0.9 [/usr/share/dotnet/shared/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App]\nMicrosoft.AspNetCore.App 10.0.0-rc.1.25451.107 [/usr/share/dotnet/shared/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App]\nMicrosoft.NETCore.App 6.0.36 [/usr/share/dotnet/shared/Microsoft.NETCore.App]\nMicrosoft.NETCore.App 7.0.20 [/usr/share/dotnet/shared/Microsoft.NETCore.App]\nMicrosoft.NETCore.App 8.0.20 [/usr/share/dotnet/shared/Microsoft.NETCore.App]\nMicrosoft.NETCore.App 9.0.9 [/usr/share/dotnet/shared/Microsoft.NETCore.App]\nMicrosoft.NETCore.App 10.0.0-rc.1.25451.107 [/usr/share/dotnet/shared/Microsoft.NETCore.App]\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3369049386/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3524223470","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111246#issuecomment-3524223470","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111246","id":3524223470,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SD2Hu","user":{"login":"jasonswearingen","id":814134,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDEzNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/814134?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonswearingen","html_url":"https://github.com/jasonswearingen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonswearingen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonswearingen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonswearingen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonswearingen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonswearingen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonswearingen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonswearingen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonswearingen/events{/pri